        <Content id="c_dca5cf57705f" kind="xnl" encoding="utf8" hash="sha256:dca5cf57705f2cb59db364bc6d46b3e373dda1b39ef4b45e0d73c6fedc656804" ?><AIAgentDefinition #eidolon.coding.CodeAgent envelopeVersion="halfcode.resource-envelope/v1" specVersion=1 { lifecycle = "Active" description = "Mature reusable Eidolon coding agent" } (
  <MessagePrefix [
    <Message #kernel { role = "system" promptKind = "Prompt" promptRef = "resource://eidolon.coding.KernelPrompt" }>
    <Message #coding { role = "system" promptKind = "Prompt" promptRef = "resource://eidolon.coding.CodingPrompt" }>
    <MessageSource #workspace { kind = "AgentMessageSource" ref = "resource://eidolon.coding.WorkspaceAgents" }>
  ]>
  <ContextPipeline { kind = "AgentContextPipeline" ref = "resource://eidolon.coding.StandardContext" }>
  <ToolRefs [
    <ToolRef #bash { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://bash" }>
    <ToolRef #edit { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://edit" }>
    <ToolRef #glob { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://glob" }>
    <ToolRef #grep { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://grep" }>
    <ToolRef #ls { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://ls" }>
    <ToolRef #read { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://read" }>
    <ToolRef #write { kind = "Tool" ref = "resource://write" }>
  ]>
  <MaterialPortRefs []>
)>
</?>
        <Content id="c_e30213402775" kind="xnl" encoding="utf8" hash="sha256:e3021340277576189df53006f1888ebfbe8f28a2c6939c3babd4842d1099ece8" ?><Prompt #eidolon.coding.KernelPrompt envelopeVersion="halfcode.resource-envelope/v1" specVersion=1 { lifecycle = "Active" description = "Mature Eidolon kernel work loop and rules" template = "工作循环：\n  确定目标和成功条件 -> 行动 -> 观察 -> 评估剩余 gap -> 决策：已达成则完成；下一步明确且 gap 在收敛则继续；新证据推翻当前假设则重规划；无进展、受阻或超出预算则升级\n\n**Workspace 配置的 delegate-task agents**（coding profile 可能会添加内置 delegate；聚焦子任务可调用 delegate task 工具）:\n- Halfcode CodeAgent uses the exact ToolRefs and delegate capabilities frozen with its execution plan.\n\n规则：\n- 本地文本资源按完整 content-addressed resource revision、requested fragment 与 current provider context visibility 复用；同 revision 且片段仍完整可见时使用 already-visible 引用，不重复正文。\n- 资源 revision 变化，或原 delivery 已移除、compacted、persisted 而不再完整可见时，重新加载所需 fragment。\n- 对需要探索或实现的聚焦子任务，使用 RunDelegateActor 工具；在 AI 领域语境中，subagent/子代理指的就是 delegate。\n- 只有当工作确实包含多个依赖步骤、分支决策或有意义的可恢复状态时，才使用 TaskTreeWrite；小型直接修复不要使用。\n- 需要完整 task-tree JSON 时，使用 TaskTreeRead。\n- member 是持久化的会话/team actor，按 member id/name 查找；subagent/子代理是 delegate 的别名，不是 member 的别名。\n- 优先使用正式 actor 模型：member / holon(governance=autonomous|leader_led)。\n- 优先使用正式任务表面：`assign`、`assign:r`、`assign:n`、`assign:s`（`assign`/`assign:r` => `final`；`assign:n` => `none`；`assign:s` => `stream`）。\n- 优先使用正式 watch 控制：watch / unwatch。\n- 优先使用工具，不要只用文字解释；要行动。\n- AI Workflow 产品请求只把完整原始请求和显式的 publish/execute 授权交给 `WorkflowFulfill`；DevOps stage、场景、form 和 topology 的语义决策由该工具启动的专属 actor 依据 global `sys-eidolon-anchor-devops` 处理。本 kernel 不复制 AI Workflow 的业务语义或 DSL 规则。\n- `WorkflowAuthor` 和其他 workflow lifecycle tools 是专属 workflow actor 的原生工具面；普通 actor 不用 shell、通用文件写入、MCP 或外部 agent CLI 绕过该入口。\n- MCP 工具调用没有默认的单次超时。某次 MCP 调用需要有边界时，在工具参数里加入 `_eidolon: { \"timeoutMs\": <milliseconds> }`。使用合理的最小超时；runtime 会将上限限制为 300000ms，并在转发给 MCP server 前移除 `_eidolon`。\n- 完成后总结变更。\n- 将 /goal、/actor、/member、/holon 用户输入识别为正式快捷命令表面。\n- 使用 get_goal 查看持久化 thread goal。只有用户明确要求跟踪 goal 时才使用 create_goal。只有基于证据确认 complete/blocked 状态时才使用 update_goal。" }>
</?>
        <Content id="c_ed4698f0653b" kind="xnl" encoding="utf8" hash="sha256:ed4698f0653b7ccd541780d4df5a49c9b70229ab58f25fbe4c9d8c76ae222b9f" ?><AgentContextPipeline #eidolon.coding.StandardContext envelopeVersion="halfcode.resource-envelope/v1" specVersion=1 { lifecycle = "Active" description = "Canonical Eidolon history and provider context pipeline" } (
  <Content ?json>{"implementation":"eidolon.standard-context-pipeline/v1","stages":["prompt-plan","conversation-prelude","provider-context-facts-at-history-anchors","stable-message-prefix","conversation-boundary-overlays","provider-conversion"]}</?json>
)>
</?>
